'''vinegar-cruet''' (vin′ẹ̄-gär-krö″et), ''n.'' A glass bottle for holding vinegar; especially, one of the bottles of a caster.

'''vinegar-eel''' (vin′ẹ̄-gär-ēl), ''n.'' A free-living nematoid worm of the family ''Anguillulidæ'',

